      "text": "The National Geographic Society has funded a documentary about Isola di Malamente, and they somehow manage to get permission to film on the island. The film crew begins receiving phone calls from someone claiming to be from National Geographic (actually Hastalyk), but they soon realize that it's someone who knows far too much about them.",
