      ],
      "crop_ids": [
        "P013-B003-TES",
        "P013-B004-TES"
      ],
      "text": "A local tour guide (Nuncio Vendra) brings a group of tourists to Isola di Malamente and abandons them there. They immediately begin trying to call for help on their cell phones to no avail. As the darkness sets in, they receive a call from Nuncio on a walkie-talkie that he planted on one of them or in their bags. He tells them that there is a chest of gold bars on the island that dates back to World War II, and if they agree to find it, he'll split it with them. If they don't, they'll never leave the island. Nuncio directs the Investigators to the dock where he has left wireless head cams for each of them and a transmitter so that he can more easily direct them. At some point during their exploration of the island, their radios begin to pick up someone else (actually Hastalyk) who claims that Nuncio is going to kill them, but if the Investigators listen to him, he'll get them off the island by dawn.",
      "heading_level": null,
      "display_style": "body",
      "text_source_state": "machine_reviewed_delegated"
    },
